) =$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\arg min_(x ∈ T)g(x) =$ {{field-2}}"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186231742 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186231450 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4f56e312-a8c4-5c65-9893-3ebc38120b4d" :knowledge-point/title "Distinguishing Between Max/Min and Argmax/Argmin"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/id #uuid "cbe9032c-6f44-58dc-9ddc-fa3ca07c4b0d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186231036} {:answer-field/id #uuid "e873c666-a858-5034-8acf-044865f6f906" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186231037} {:answer-field/id #uuid "1ee2f779-c391-500f-97a7-e605497c97aa" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186231038} {:answer-field/id #uuid "6d82f40d-9e66-5857-827e-a182d65aadbe" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186231039}] :question/id #uuid "6f68d534-8f10-5941-a10d-ac65abf5c7b1" :question/math-academy-id "q-355267" :question/problem "Let $S = {2, 4, 6, 8}$ and suppose\n$g(2) = 5, g(4) =-3, g(6) = 10, g(8) = 0$.\nCompute the following:$max_(x ∈ S)g(x) =$\n{{field-1}} $\\arg max_(x ∈ S)g(x) =$\n{{field-2}} $min_(x ∈ S)g(x) =$\n{{field-3}} $\\arg min_(x ∈ S)g(x) =$\n{{field-4}}"}]}
